      ],
      "text": "Mistress Dusklight shoots a captivating look at one creature within 60 feet, who must be Stupefied. Until the end of its next turn, the creature is fascinated by Mistress Dusklight and can't use hostile actions toward her. The victim is then temporarily immune for 10 minutes."
